  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## What's New in 1.6.0-beta-001\n\n### Features\n- Added native ASP.NET Core `Context` integration via the new `Concur.Extensions.AspNetCore` package\n- Added `Context` cancellation propagation through goroutine scheduling and WaitGroup waits\n- Enhanced `WithCancel` methods to support external token linking for better cancellation control\n\n### Improvements\n- Improved XML documentation coverage for all public APIs\n- Hardened test timeouts for better reliability in thread-pool dependent tests\n- Enhanced cancellation semantics for operation-scoped contexts\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- Replaced `SemaphoreSlim` with custom `AsyncCounterGate` in `MpmcBoundedChannel` for improved flexibility and performance",
